{
  "about": "The wire shapes protocol v7.2 (final) changed or added, WRITTEN BY HAND, word by word, from the Solidity tuples (abi.encode head/tail rules): BUY and SELL with their minimum and their deadline, OPEN (op 6), MOVE (op 7), and the four-field envelope. Each vector is the list of its 32-byte words with what each one is - the annotated layout, for a reader and as a second witness: contracts/scripts/gen-codec-vectors.js holds every vector here to the contracts' coder and exits 1 on a difference, and both codec suites (msg_codec.rs, app/test/codec.test.ts) hold their codec to it. The vectors the suites run on first are the generated ones, tests/codec-vectors-v72.gen.json.",
